    {
      "id": 131640,
      "name": "Donner",
      "username": "Donner",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/{size}/1903_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-18T16:53:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I found out that I actually watched both seasons. &nbsp;On Netflix, each episode is 2 hours and 6 minutes long. &nbsp;Apparently the normal episodes are about 16 minutes. &nbsp;I can tell you that if I hadn't finished the 2 hours and 6 minutes episode, I would not have enjoyed just watching 3 episodes at 16 minutes apiece. &nbsp;After about 1/4 of the show I was like, \"Well, I started watching. &nbsp;Might as well finish.\" &nbsp;But by the end I really enjoyed it. &nbsp;So, take that for what it's worth. :D</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:06:59.183Z",
